Tests for 0104. DCS motion fixtures: a fourth and fifth composition per scene (the shipping one and the flow alone with
the quality options, XRFG_TEST_FG_QUALITY=<bits>, all by default), the fallback share, XRFG_TEST_SRGB_VIEW=1 (every scene
read through an sRGB view), XRFG_TEST_DUMP_DIR (PPM dumps); new scenes: the occlusion at night (a grey aircraft 0.02-0.06
over a 0.002 sky, MVs at 10 and 3 pixels a texel, UNORM and sRGB views; regions aircraft, trailing, leading, sky) and the
world beside a cockpit mask's blocks. synthesize_nvidia_pair: a view format and XRFG_TEST_FG_QUALITY_ALL_PAIRS. DCS motion
bench: XRFG_TEST_FG_QUALITY_BENCH=<bits> (both pipelines with MVs, the second with the options; pack, flow and whole-pair
medians). New ctest xrfg_d3d12_temporal_hints (a sequence of pairs, hints off / on). Foveated quality bench:
XRFG_FOVEATED_QUALITY_FG=<bits> on the fill2 modes' focus layer. Live ini parse test for the quality keys.

